ingredientsText:
Fermented, Organic Protein & Greens contains:
Organic Protein Blend (71%) (pea protein, rice protein, amaranth, hemp protein, quinoa);
Fermented Organic Fruit, Vegetable & Green Blend (alfalfa grass, barley grass, wheat grass, apple, blueberry, cranberry, carrot, cilantro, parsley, artichoke, black radish, dandelion, kale, celery, beet, spinach, tomato, broccoli, red radish, cabbage, upland cress, cauliflower, arugula, watercress, basil, peppers, swiss chard, spearmint);
Organic alkalised cocoa powder,
Organic flavours,
Organic acerola cherry extract,
Sweetener (organic steviol glycoside);
Organic Mushroom Blend (cordyceps, reishi, himematsutake, shiitake, maitake, turkey tail).
